<body>
<h1 class="main-title">Student Performance Analysis Demonstration</h1>
<div class="meta-field"><span class="meta-label">Title:</span> Student Performance Report using Classes, Objects, and Arrays</div>
<div class="meta-field"><span class="meta-label">Objective/Aim:</span><br>To design and implement a Java program to store student details, calculate total marks, average, highest marks, lowest marks, percentage, grade, and evaluation remark using arrays, methods, and classes.</div>

<h2 class="section-header">System Requirements :</h2>
<div class="sub-heading">Hardware</div>
<ul><li>Standard PC/Laptop</li><li>Intel Core i3/i5 processor or equivalent</li><li>Minimum 4 GB RAM</li><li>Minimum 500 MB free storage</li><li>Keyboard and Monitor</li></ul>
<div class="sub-heading">Software</div>
<ul><li>Operating System: Windows/Linux/macOS</li><li>Java Development Kit (JDK 17 or JDK 21)</li><li>Text Editor or IDE such as Eclipse, IntelliJ IDEA, NetBeans, or VS Code</li><li>Command Prompt/Terminal</li></ul>

<h2 class="section-header">Algorithm / Logic Description:</h2>
<ol>
<li>Create a class named <code>Student</code> with attributes <code>rollNo</code>, <code>name</code>, and an integer array <code>marks[]</code>.</li>
<li>Define a constructor to initialize the student details and subject marks.</li>
<li>Define a method <code>calculateTotal()</code> to sum all elements in the <code>marks[]</code> array.</li>
<li>Define <code>calculateAverage()</code> to compute the mean value of subject marks.</li>
<li>Define <code>highestMarks()</code> and <code>lowestMarks()</code> using <code>Math.max()</code> and <code>Math.min()</code> iteratively.</li>
<li>Define <code>calculatePercentage()</code> to compute percentage based on a 500 total mark scale rounded to two decimal places.</li>
<li>Define <code>getGrade()</code> to assign letter grades (A+, A, B, C, D, F) based on percentage cutoffs.</li>
<li>Define <code>getRemark()</code> to assign descriptive academic performance remarks corresponding to the grade.</li>
<li>Define <code>displayReport()</code> to format and print the complete academic performance card.</li>
<li>Create the <code>StudentPerformanceAnalysis</code> class containing the <code>main()</code> method to instantiate a <code>Student</code> object and invoke <code>displayReport()</code>.</li>
<li>Stop the program.</li>
</ol>

<div class="page-break"></div>
<h2 class="section-header">UML class Diagram</h2>
<div class="uml-container">
<div class="uml-box" style="width:85%;margin:0 auto;">
<div class="uml-class-header">Student</div>
